program	errors/print_optional_not_printable.saw
triple	arm64-apple-darwin
twin	same
expect	error
build	refused	cannot print value of type `Int?`: it is not `Printable`
meets_expect	yes
log	"error: cannot print value of type `Int?`: it is not `Printable`"
log	"  --> examples/errors/print_optional_not_printable.saw:19:11"
