log	"error: cannot print value of type `Int?`: it is not `Printable`"
log	"  --> examples/errors/print_optional_not_printable.saw:22:12"
log	"     |"
log	" 22 |     print(v.get(0))"
log	"     |            ^"
log	"   hint: unwrap it first — `if let v = o` / `o ?? <fallback>` — since an optional cannot be given a `Printable` conformance of its own"
log	""
log	"error: cannot interpolate value of type `Int?` in a string: it is not `Printable`"
log	"  --> examples/errors/print_optional_not_printable.saw:23:14"
log	"     |"
log	" 23 |     print(\"{v.get(0)}\")"
log	"     |              ^"
